.710">would </span><span begin="00:35.710" end="00:38.170">break</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.130" end="00:44.470"><span begin="00:39.130" end="00:39.430">But </span><span begin="00:39.430" end="00:39.610">I </span><span begin="00:39.610" end="00:39.790">will </span><span begin="00:39.790" end="00:40.420">fight </span><span begin="00:40.420" end="00:41.110">until </span><span begin="00:41.110" end="00:41.230">the </span><span begin="00:41.230" end="00:41.770">day </span><span begin="00:41.770" end="00:41.920">the </span><span begin="00:41.920" end="00:42.220">world </span><span begin="00:42.220" end="00:42.640">stops </span><span begin="00:42.640" end="00:44.470">turning</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.710" end="00:48.940"><span begin="00:44.710" end="00:44.890">And </span><span begin="00:44.890" end="00:45.130">they </span><span begin="00:45.130" end="00:45.310">will </span><span begin="00:45.310" end="00:45.850">fall </span><span begin="00:45.850" end="00:46.090">to </span><span begin="00:46.090" end="00:46.810">ashes</span><span begin="00:46.810" end="00:46.960">, </span><span begin="00:46.960" end="00:47.170">I </span><span begin="00:47.170" end="00:47.410">will </span><span begin="00:47.410" end="00:47.830">just </span><span begin="00:47.830" end="00:48.130">keep </span><span begin="00:48.130" end="00:48.940">burning</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.970" end="00:53.230"><span begin="00:48.970" end="00:49.300">But </span><span begin="00:49.300" end="00:50.710">tonight </span><span begin="00:50.710" end="00:50.920">I </span><span begin="00:50.920" end="00:51.220">need </span><span begin="00:51.220" end="00:51.550">you </span><span begin="00:51.550" end="00:51.670">to </span><span begin="00:51.670" end="00:52.090">save </span><span begin="00:52.090" end="00:53.230">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.500" end="00:57.040"><span begin="00:53.500" end="00:53.710">I'm </span><span begin="00:53.710" end="00:53.950">too </span><span 